{"name": "Mechs V Kaijus 2", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mechs V Kaijus 2</strong> is an Hybrid Tower/Base defense, with army vs army (tug of war style) tactics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From commanding a Mech  to build a huge bases with reactors, mines, factories and all type of defenses and super weapons. Manage a rich game economy with 3 resources, energy, metal and ammunition.\u00a0<br/>Control squad of epic mechs, place your defenses build your base and train your army, the Kaiju Horde is back in epic scale conflict!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4439370/extras/eb623e4fb5b940e2a9791f172fa8a13e.poster.avif?t=1785441875\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4439370/extras/eb623e4fb5b940e2a9791f172fa8a13e.webm?t=1785441875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4439370/extras/eb623e4fb5b940e2a9791f172fa8a13e.mp4?t=1785441875\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><br/></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4439370/extras/ff96f0d3b86f049997d730b8ff1011bf.poster.avif?t=1785441875\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4439370/extras/ff96f0d3b86f049997d730b8ff1011bf.webm?t=1785441875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4439370/extras/ff96f0d3b86f049997d730b8ff1011bf.mp4?t=1785441875\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Kaiju are back to <strong>xenoforming</strong> our planet, they build bases, refineries, defenses and farms. Engage in new epic battles in this new base vs base mode.\u00a0<br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4439370/extras/bdab539f128b6eee8e93a5b922a5bb68.poster.avif?t=1785441875\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4439370/extras/bdab539f128b6eee8e93a5b922a5bb68.webm?t=1785441875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4439370/extras/bdab539f128b6eee8e93a5b922a5bb68.mp4?t=1785441875\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><br/><br/><strong>In Direct Mode</strong>,\u00a0take control of any mech in the field, boosting their stats and DPS! Use this mode to push the enemy line or make a critical defense move. By the way, mechs walk this time! :D</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4439370/extras/3222c635ea802d8fa46039282a4a6c63.poster.avif?t=1785441875\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4439370/extras/3222c635ea802d8fa46039282a4a6c63.webm?t=1785441875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4439370/extras/3222c635ea802d8fa46039282a4a6c63.mp4?t=1785441875\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Nuclear Conflict:</strong>\u00a0<br/>T.R.O.S. and The Kaiju Horde have nuclear arsenal of their own. And to counter that nuclear defenses and satellited weapons.\u00a0 Engage in full scale nuclear conflict with nukes and anti nuke missiles launching across the sky.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4439370/extras/7c7a7a5b1a7f1edcce2aa9c30861f972.poster.avif?t=1785441875\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4439370/extras/7c7a7a5b1a7f1edcce2aa9c30861f972.webm?t=1785441875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4439370/extras/7c7a7a5b1a7f1edcce2aa9c30861f972.mp4?t=1785441875\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Epic Scale conflict: Build jet, tanks, drones, helicopters, carriers and more! Raise your drone, army your tank company or just boom the hell out of the kaiju. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4439370/extras/28124b0d64a860e590fb203711a9a1d8.poster.avif?t=1785441875\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4439370/extras/28124b0d64a860e590fb203711a9a1d8.webm?t=1785441875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4439370/extras/28124b0d64a860e590fb203711a9a1d8.mp4?t=1785441875\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lore:</strong><br/>The Kaiju Horde has return, and this time has a plan to conquer the Earth, the key battlefield The Pacific Ring Of Fire in the Pacific Ocean. After a planetary surprise attack most pacific nations falls. T.R.O.S. Defenses fall back to Antarctica from witch launch a full counter attack to retake the Earth.\u00a0<br/></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Mechs V Kaijus 2 is an Hybrid Tower/Base defense, with army vs army (tug of war style) tactics. From the cockpit of a mech, to build a huge base with Reactors, Mines and all type of tower army factories and super weapons.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4439370/85bc6035c9c8d58c1de9855478e63ffbef20070d/header.jpg?t=1785441875", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Strategy", "Tower Defense", "Action RTS", "Pixel Graphics", "Atmospheric", "Mechs"], "developers": "Doble Punch Games", "publishers": "Doble Punch Games", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4439370", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "17 May 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/bE0JVsFqXNo", "first_seen": 1778968800.0, "review_rank": 633}